  "title": "Chef John’s Cioppino",
  "description": "This cioppino recipe is a version of San Francisco’s famous dish that has it all. A tangy, spicy broth featuring shrimp, mussels, cod, and Dungeness crab.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-25T15:03:54-04:00",
